fn witnessHead(self: Session&,value: ValueId) -> u32,Error { var actual=valueEvidence(self,value); if actual==0&&valueInfo(self,value).kind==ValueKind.closure { let closure=closureInfo(self,value); let owner=findUnit(self,closure.unit,blot_support::none<i64>()); if !owner.present { return 0,Error.none; } let module=self.units[owner.value]; var ty: u32=0; match closure.origin { anonymous=>{ ty=module.closures[closure.identity].function_type; },named=>{ ty=module.binding(closure.identity).ty; },constructor=>{ ty=module.constructor(closure.identity).scheme.root; },primitive=>{ ty=closure.ty; },operation=>{ ty=module.operation_values[closure.identity].signature; }, } var count=0; while count<1024 { let n=module.types.node(ty); if n.tag!=TypeTag.function { break; } ty=n.b; count++; } if count==1024 { return 0,Error.none; } let projected,error=projectType(self,owner.value,0,ty,self.storage.type_mappings[closure.mappings.start..closure.mappings.start+closure.mappings.len],self.storage.row_mappings[closure.row_mappings.start..closure.row_mappings.start+closure.row_mappings.len]); if error!=Error.none { return 0,error; } actual=projected; }
