fn referenceExpression(self: Session&,owner: i64,id: u32,frame: Frame&) -> Flow,Error { let module=self.units[owner]; let n=module.node(id); let declared=module.reference(id); if declared.unit==0||declared.unit==unitId(self,owner) { let local=frame.values.get(declared.binding); if local { return Flow.value {local},Error.none; } }
